    "body": "The focus fixup rule justifies it: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#focus-fixup-rule\r\n\r\n> When the designated [focused area of the document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#focused-area-of-the-document) is removed from that [Document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#document) in some way (e.g. it stops being a [focusable area](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#focusable-area), it is removed from the DOM, it becomes [inert](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#inert), etc.), designate the [Document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#document)'s [viewport](https://drafts.csswg.org/css2/#viewport) to be the new [focused area of the document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#focused-area-of-the-document).",
